@startuml local-stack
title Local stack (docker compose)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "You" as you
node "docker compose" {
  component "n8n\n:5678" as n8n
  component "docsync engine\n:8088\n(FastAPI + mock Confluence)" as eng
  component "Kroki\n:8000" as kroki
  component "Structurizr Lite\n:8080 (profile)" as slite
  database "./data\nrepos/ (git), docsync.sqlite3,\nconfluence-mock/, build/" as data
}
you --> n8n : docsync demo push\n(GitLab Push Hook simulation)
you --> n8n : approve link
you --> eng : /mock-confluence/<id>\n/docs (OpenAPI)
n8n --> eng : /api/v1/*
eng --> kroki : render
eng --> data
slite --> data : architecture-model
@enduml
